%%{init: { "theme": "default", "sequence": { "showSequenceNumbers": true } } }%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant B as Browser<br/>(next-auth, @keycloak/js)
    participant N as Next.js server<br/>(/api/auth/*)
    participant KC as Keycloak realm<br/>'motion-forge'
    participant IDP as External IdP<br/>(Entra / Google / Okta / OneLogin)
    participant API as engine/crates/http<br/>(axum, JWT verify)
    participant R as Redis<br/>(JWKS cache, 12 h)
    participant KV as Azure Key Vault<br/>(client secret)

    U->>B: Visit https://motion.ursly.io
    B->>N: GET /
    N-->>B: 302 to Keycloak /auth?<br/>client_id=motion-forge-web&<br/>response_type=code&<br/>code_challenge=S256(verifier)
    B->>KC: GET /realms/motion-forge/protocol/<br/>openid-connect/auth (PKCE)

    alt User is federated
        KC-->>B: 302 to external IdP
        B->>IDP: SAML/OIDC handshake
        IDP-->>B: assertion / id_token
        B->>KC: POST back to Keycloak broker
    else Local Keycloak user
        KC-->>B: Login form
        B->>KC: POST credentials
    end

    KC-->>B: 302 with authorization_code
    B->>N: GET /api/auth/callback/keycloak?code=...
    N->>KV: Fetch Keycloak client_secret
    N->>KC: POST /token<br/>(code + verifier + client_secret)
    KC-->>N: access_token (JWT, RS256) +<br/>id_token + refresh_token
    N-->>B: Set-Cookie: __Secure-next-auth.session-token<br/>(HTTP-only, SameSite=Lax, encrypted)

    Note over B,API: Subsequent API call

    B->>N: POST /api/proxy/generate<br/>(cookie)
    N->>N: Decrypt cookie, extract access_token
    N->>API: POST /generate<br/>Authorization: Bearer <access_token>

    API->>R: GET jwks:keycloak
    alt JWKS cache miss
        R-->>API: nil
        API->>KC: GET /realms/motion-forge/<br/>protocol/openid-connect/certs
        KC-->>API: JWKS
        API->>R: SET jwks:keycloak (TTL 12 h)
    else JWKS cache hit
        R-->>API: JWKS
    end

    API->>API: Verify signature (RS256)<br/>+ iss + aud + exp +<br/>extract tenantId + roles
    API->>API: Check Redis leaky bucket<br/>rl:tenant:<tenantId>
    API->>API: Dispatch to route handler

    API-->>N: 202 Accepted + run_id
    N-->>B: 202 + run_id

    Note over B,N: Refresh-token rotation

    B->>N: GET /api/auth/session<br/>(cookie close to expiry)
    N->>KC: POST /token<br/>grant_type=refresh_token
    KC-->>N: new access_token + new refresh_token
    N-->>B: Set-Cookie (rotated)
